          "Homeowners call. So do spouses who didn't handle the last claim. So do adult kids helping a parent. Decision-maker rules matter because supplements, deductibles, and scope arguments take more than one person. A tenant calling about a leak is usually a property-manager problem. If you don't do property management accounts, dump them early.",
