          "CPL fits retail replacement, off-season, and follow-up heavy processes. Name, address, roof age, insurance yes/no, photos if you can get them. Your estimator works a route, not a panic board. During a hail event, CPL without a same-hour call is slow. Use live transfer when the radar just rolled through.",
