          "CPL is common in this vertical because many funnels are form-plus-callback: ZIP, own/rent, DIY vs pro, existing system. Callback speed matters. A security shopper will order a kit from a big brand site while your BDR is in standup. If you can't call fast, buy live transfers or put click-to-call on the page.",
